{"hits": {"hits": [{"created": "2026-10-19T06:10:06.081629+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-19T06:10:06.544266+00:00", "id": 23466248, "conceptrecid": "23466247", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23466248", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23466247", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23466248", "metadata": {"title": "OILADA SHAXSLARARO MUNOSABATLAR TIZIMIGA XOS UMUMIY XUSUSIYATLAR VA MUAMMOLAR TAHLILI", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23466248", "publication_date": "2026-10-15", "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><span>Mazkur tezisda oilada shaxslararo munosabatlar tizimiga xos umumiy xususiyatlar va asosiy muammolar tahlil qilingan. Oilaviy tizim nazariyalari asosida munosabatlarning hissiy yaqinlik, rollar taqsimoti, muloqot va madaniy qadriyatlar kabi jihatlari yoritilgan. Muloqot buzilishlari, rollar nizosi, avlodlararo ziddiyatlar va raqamli muhitning oilaviy munosabatlarga ta&rsquo;siri aniqlangan hamda ularni uyg&lsquo;unlashtirish yo&lsquo;nalishlari ko&lsquo;rsatilgan.</span></em></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Xamrayeva Gulmira Jamshid qizi", "affiliation": null}], "resource_type": {"title": "Conference paper", "type": "publication", "subtype": "conferencepaper"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23466247"}}]}}, "title": "OILADA SHAXSLARARO MUNOSABATLAR TIZIMIGA XOS UMUMIY XUSUSIYATLAR VA MUAMMOLAR TAHLILI", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23466248", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23466248", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23466248?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23466248", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23466248", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23466248", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23466248/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23466247", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23466247", "parent_doi": "h